- [minor] The live_preview parameter in the interface types (IContentstackGetEntry, IContentstackGetSingleEntry, IContentstackGetSingletonEntry) is added but its type is not visible in the source read — ensure it is explicitly typed as boolean | undefined (or the SDK's LivePreviewConfig type), not implicit any. (src/services/contentstack.ts)
